        "id": "major-question-01",
        "label": "第Ⅰ問",
        "order": 1,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>第Ⅰ問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>問1</dt><dd>1−⑥／2−④／3−③／4−⑦／5−⑧</dd></div><div><dt>問2</dt><dd>6−②／7−②／8−⑧</dd></div><div><dt>問3</dt><dd>9−③／10−④／11−⑥／12−①</dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>最初に確認</strong><p>第Ⅰ問は、保存則を使う場面と、円運動・放物運動・衝突・相対運動へ切り替える場面を区別します。各段階で正の向きと位置エネルギーの基準を先に書いてください。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説《円弧状のパイプ内を運動する小球》</h3></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問1 (1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">最低点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"S\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を重力による位置エネルギーの基準とし、点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> での速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とする。力学的エネルギー保存則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"mgr=\\frac12mv_R^2+mg\\frac r2\\quad\\therefore\\quad v_R=\\sqrt{gr}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問1 (2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> から最高点までの時間を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、最高点の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とする。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"0=\\sqrt{gr}\\sin\\frac\\pi3-gt_1\\quad\\therefore\\quad t_1=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{3r}{g}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"0=(\\sqrt{gr}\\sin\\frac\\pi3)^2-2g(y_1-\\frac32r)\\quad\\therefore\\quad y_1=\\frac{15}{8}r\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">最高点から床までの時間を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、落下点の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とする。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"y_1=\\frac12gt_2^2\\quad\\therefore\\quad t_2=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac{15r}{g}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_2=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}r+\\sqrt{gr}\\cos\\frac\\pi3(t_1+t_2)=\\frac{3\\sqrt3+\\sqrt{15}}4r\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2 (1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">衝突直前のAの速度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、直後のA、Bの速度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_A,v_B\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とする。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"mgr=\\frac12mv_0^2,\\quad mv_0=mv_A+Mv_B,\\quad e=\\frac{v_B-v_A}{v_0}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_A=\\frac{m-eM}{M+m}\\sqrt{2gr},\\qquad v_B=\\frac{(1+e)m}{M+m}\\sqrt{2gr}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2 (2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">糸の長さが <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の単振り子とみなせるので、周期は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2\\pi\\sqrt{r/g}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>。点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"S\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> に初めて戻る時間は周期の半分。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"t=\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac rg}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">力学的エネルギー保存則と近似式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12mv_A^2=mgr(1-\\cos\\varphi)\\simeq\\frac12mgr\\varphi^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\varphi=\\frac{\\sqrt2|m-eM|}{M+m}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問3 (1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">最低点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"S\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 通過時の小球の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とする。系の重心の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標は変わらない。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_3=-\\frac{mr}{M&#39;+m}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">小球と台車の速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_3,v_3&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とする。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"0=mv_3+M&#39;v_3&#39;,\\qquad mgr=\\frac12mv_3^2+\\frac12M&#39;v_3&#39;^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_3=\\sqrt{\\frac{2M&#39;}{M&#39;+m}gr}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問3 (2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 通過時の小球の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_4\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とすると、重心位置不変より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_4=\\frac{\\sqrt3M&#39;-2m}{2(M&#39;+m)}r\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">台車の速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、小球の水平速度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、台車から見た相対速度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"u\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とする。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"0=mv_x+M&#39;(-V),\\qquad v_x-(-V)=u\\cos\\frac\\pi3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac Vu=\\frac{m}{2(M&#39;+m)}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "第Ⅱ問",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>第Ⅱ問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>問1</dt><dd>13−③／14−④／15−③／16−③／17−②</dd></div><div><dt>問2</dt><dd>18−④／19−①／20−①／21−⑨／22−④／23−③／24−⑤</dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>最初に確認</strong><p>定常状態とスイッチ直後を分けます。十分時間後のコンデンサー電流、コイル電圧、直後に連続なコンデンサー電圧を先に確定してから式を立てます。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説《定電流電源を用いた直流回路、電気振動》</h3></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問1 (1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">十分に長い時間後、コンデンサーに電流は流れない。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V=RI\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問1 (2)</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"P=VI=RI^2,\\qquad Q=CV=CRI\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問1 (3)</h3><p class=\"prose\">電気容量を瞬時に増やすと電気量が変わらないため電圧が下がり、供給電力は減少する。十分に長い時間後の電圧は挿入前と同じになり、供給電力も変わらない。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2 (1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">十分に長い時間後、コイル電流は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> で一定、コイル電圧とコンデンサー電圧は0。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"E=\\frac12LI^2,\\qquad Q=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2 (2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">スイッチを開く直前直後のコンデンサー電圧は0だから、コイル電圧も0。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2 (3)</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12LI^2=\\frac{Q_{\\max}^2}{2C}\\quad\\therefore\\quad Q_{\\max}=I\\sqrt{CL}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_{\\max}=\\frac{Q_{\\max}}C=I\\sqrt{\\frac LC}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2 (4)</h3><p class=\"prose\">電流が初めて0になるまでの時間は電気振動の周期 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2\\pi\\sqrt{CL}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1/4\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"t=\\frac\\pi2\\sqrt{CL}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">電流 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> に依存せず、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"C\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を2倍にすると <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 倍。</p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "第Ⅲ問",
        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>第Ⅲ問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>問1</dt><dd>25−③／26−⑤</dd></div><div><dt>問2</dt><dd>27−③／28−⑤</dd></div><div><dt>問3</dt><dd>29−③／30−⑤／31−③</dd></div><div><dt>問4</dt><dd>32−③／33−④／34−④／35−⑥</dd></div><div><dt>問5</dt><dd>36−⑤</dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>最初に確認</strong><p>A→Bは定圧、B→CとD→Aは断熱、C→Dは定圧です。各過程の前後の状態量を表に置き、熱・内部エネルギー・仕事の符号を統一します。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説《p−V図と熱サイクル》</h3></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問1</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_0S+mg=p_AS\\quad\\therefore\\quad p_A=p_0+\\frac{mg}{S}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_ASh=nRT_A\\quad\\therefore\\quad T_A=\\frac{p_ASh}{nR}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2</h3><p class=\"prose\">A→Bは定圧変化。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_B=p_A,\\qquad \\frac{Sh}{T_A}=\\frac{2Sh}{T_B}\\quad\\therefore\\quad T_B=2T_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\Delta U_{AB}=\\frac32nR(T_B-T_A)=\\frac32nRT_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q_{AB}=\\frac52nR(T_B-T_A)=\\frac52nRT_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問3</h3><p class=\"prose\">B→Cは断熱変化。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_B(2Sh)^\\gamma=p_C(Sh)^\\gamma\\quad\\therefore\\quad p_C=2^\\gamma p_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_0S+(m+M)g=p_CS\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"M=(2^\\gamma-1)(\\frac{p_0S}{g}+m)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{p_ASh}{T_A}=\\frac{p_CSh}{T_C}\\quad\\therefore\\quad T_C=2^\\gamma T_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">B→Cで気体が外部からされた仕事 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は内部エネルギーの変化量に等しい。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"W=\\frac32nR(T_C-T_B)=3(2^{\\gamma-1}-1)nRT_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問4</h3><p class=\"prose\">C→Dは定圧変化、D→Aは断熱変化。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_D=p_C=2^\\gamma p_A,\\qquad p_D(Sh_D)^\\gamma=p_A(Sh)^\\gamma\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"h_D=\\frac h2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{p_DSh_D}{T_D}=\\frac{p_ASh}{T_A}\\quad\\therefore\\quad T_D=2^{\\gamma-1}T_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"-\\Delta U_{CD}=\\frac32\\,2^{\\gamma-1}nRT_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q&#39;_{CD}=\\frac52\\,2^{\\gamma-1}nRT_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問5</h3><p class=\"prose\">1サイクルで内部エネルギー変化は0。仕事の合計は、気体が受けた熱量から取り去られた熱量を引いたもの。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q_{AB}-Q&#39;_{CD}=\\frac52nRT_A-\\frac52\\,2^{\\gamma-1}nRT_A=-\\frac52(2^{\\gamma-1}-1)nRT_A\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><ul class=\"batch-answer-list\"><li><strong>第Ⅰ問</strong> 問1(1)と問2(1)を先に確保し、斜方投射と台車の相対速度は正方向を図示してから戻る。</li><li><strong>第Ⅱ問</strong> 定常状態の短問を先に取り、LC振動はエネルギー保存と周期の4分の1をセットで覚える。</li><li><strong>第Ⅲ問</strong> 状態Aの圧力・温度とA→Bを先に確保し、断熱過程はpV^γ一定を状態間で丁寧に結ぶ。</li></ul><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>時間配分</strong><p>物理60分の仮予算では、第Ⅱ問の短問と第Ⅰ問の独立小問を先に取り、台車の相対速度と熱サイクル後半を最後に回します。</p></aside></section></div></article>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "source": {
